    "updated_at": "2022-02-14T15:21:53Z",
    "body": "We have https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#processing-link-headers which is not much, but tries to handwave some stuff (like, it implies that stylesheet from `Link` headers come before stylesheets from `<link>` elements, in terms of cascade order and `document.styleSheets`.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#interactions-of-styling-and-scripting also has a note.\r\n\r\nAt a basic level, I wonder how many of the [link types](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#linkTypes) that are external resource links are also supported in header form.",
